# Submission repository: track source, tests, solution, and final specification.
# Everything else stays local, including the Word report kept outside this folder.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/part1/
!/part2/

# Part 1 contains source and test files without project files.
/part1/**
!/part1/**/
!/part1/**/*.cs

# Part 2: the ASP.NET Core solution, source projects, tests, and final API/TZ.
/part2/**
!/part2/**/
!/part2/SubscriptionReminders.sln
!/part2/src/**/*.cs
!/part2/src/**/*.csproj
!/part2/src/**/appsettings.json
!/part2/tests/**/*.cs
!/part2/tests/**/*.csproj
!/part2/tests/*.ps1
!/part2/tests/*.runsettings
!/part2/docs/REQUIREMENTS.md

# Build products, downloaded packages, test output, and editor state.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/packages/
**/node_modules/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.user
*.suo
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.opencover.xml
*.cobertura.xml
*.md
!/part2/docs/REQUIREMENTS.md

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
/graft/
